      "date": "2026-02-16T08:21:15.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.70 (vs ₹18.40 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.70 (down from ₹18.40 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹17.1b (flat on 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹147.6m (down 75% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.9% (down from 3.4% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 49% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 17% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
